<title>DENMARK: Danish Q3 96 GDP up 2.7 pct yr/yr, 1.0 pct qtr/qtr.</title>
<headline>Danish Q3 96 GDP up 2.7 pct yr/yr, 1.0 pct qtr/qtr.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish GDP rose 2.7 percent year-on-year in the third quarter of 1996 and 1.0 percent from the second quarter of 1996, the National Statistics Office said on Friday.</p>
<p>					Q3 1996   Q2 1996     Q3 1995</p>
<p>    GDP pct change from	  1.0	 1.1	    0.7</p>
<p>previous qtr (seasonally adjusted)</p>
<p>A panel of analysts polled by Reuters forecast an average 2.2 percent third quarter 1996 yr/yr rise in GDP growth</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom, 45-33-966950</p>
